Problem 1

You ran:

curl -I https://iapp192644.croydon.ms.com:6165

In PowerShell, curl is an alias for Invoke-WebRequest, which prompts for the -Uri parameter if used incorrectly.

Use one of these instead:

Invoke-WebRequest -Uri "https://iapp192644.croydon.ms.com:6165" -Method Head

or

iwr -Uri "https://iapp192644.croydon.ms.com:6165" -Method Head
Problem 2

Even better, use the real Windows curl executable:

curl.exe -k -I https://iapp192644.croydon.ms.com:6165

or

curl.exe http://iapp192644.croydon.ms.com:6165
